## 17. Naming Conventions Cheat Sheet

| Concept | Convention | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Module folder | `kebab-case` | `rental-service` |
| Java package | `camelCase` (no hyphen) | `rentalservice` |
| Application class | `PascalCase` + `Application` | `RentalServiceApplication` |
| Entity class | `PascalCase` | `Rental` |
| DTO Request | `<Entity>Request` | `RentalRequest` |
| DTO Update | `<Entity>UpdateRequest` | `RentalUpdateRequest` |
| DTO Response | `<Entity>Response` | `RentalResponse` |
| Mapper | `<Entity>Mapper` | `RentalMapper` |
| Repository | `<Entity>Repository` | `RentalRepository` |
| Service interface | `<Entity>Service` | `RentalService` |
| Service impl | `<Entity>ServiceImpl` | `RentalServiceImpl` |
| Controller | `<Entity>Controller` | `RentalController` |
| REST base path | `/api/v1/<entities>` (plural, kebab) | `/api/v1/rentals` |
| Cache names | `"<entities>"` + `"<entity>"` | `"rentals", "rental"` |
| Server port | Increment from last module | `8090, 8091, 8092...` |

