## 6. Step 4 — JPA Entity Checklist

Every entity must have:

```java
@Getter @Setter
@Entity
@Table(name = "table_name")
public class MyEntity implements Serializable {

    @Serial
    private static final long serialVersionUID = <generated_long>L;

    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    @Column(name = "my_entity_id", ...)
    private Integer id;   // or Short for tinyint UNSIGNED

    // String fields:
    @Size(max = 50)
    @NotNull
    @Column(name = "col", nullable = false, length = 50)
    private String col;

    // FK fields (ManyToOne):
    @NotNull
    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY, optional = false)
    @JoinColumn(name = "fk_id", nullable = false)
    private OtherEntity otherEntity;

    // Audit:
    @NotNull
    @ColumnDefault("CURRENT_TIMESTAMP")
    @Column(name = "last_update", nullable = false)
    private Instant lastUpdate;
}
```

---

## 7. Step 5 — DTO Records

### Rules
- **All DTOs are Java records** (no classes).
- **Separate records** for `Request` (create), `UpdateRequest` (update/patch), `Response` (read).
- Every field must have appropriate **Bean Validation** annotations.
- Import order: `java.*` → blank → `jakarta.validation.*`.

### Validation annotations per type

| Field type | Required | Optional |
|---|---|---|
| `String` required | `@NotBlank` + `@Size(max=N)` | — |
| `String` optional | `@Size(max=N)` | — |
| `String` email | `@Email` + `@Size(max=50)` | — |
| `String` phone | `@Pattern(regexp="^[+\\d\\s\\-()]*$")` + `@Size` | — |
| FK id (`Integer`) | `@NotNull` + `@Positive` | — |
| FK id (`Short`) | `@NotNull` + `@Positive` | — |
| `Boolean` | `@NotNull` | — |
| `BigDecimal` | `@NotNull` + `@DecimalMin` + `@Digits` | — |
| `Instant` required | `@NotNull` | — |

### Template — Request record

```java
package com.me.learning.parent.{{PKG}}.dto;

import jakarta.validation.constraints.NotBlank;
import jakarta.validation.constraints.NotNull;
import jakarta.validation.constraints.Positive;
import jakarta.validation.constraints.Size;

public record {{Entity}}Request(

        @NotBlank(message = "Name must not be blank")
        @Size(max = 50, message = "Name must not exceed 50 characters")
        String name,

        @NotNull(message = "Parent ID must not be null")
        @Positive(message = "Parent ID must be a positive number")
        Integer parentId

) {
}
```

### Template — Response record

```java
package com.me.learning.parent.{{PKG}}.dto;

import java.time.Instant;

public record {{Entity}}Response(

        Integer id,
        String name,
        Integer parentId,
        String parentName,
        Instant lastUpdate

) {
}
```

